 create a stronger emotional connection and feel more like a family member than just a pet.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are some unique African Elephant names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"For unique African Elephant names 🐘, consider fantasy-inspired options, names from foreign languages, or creative invented combinations. Our Fantasy Names and Unique Names categories feature one-of-a-kind options drawn from mythology, literature, and pure imagination. You can also draw inspiration from your favorite books, movies, or video games!\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should my African Elephant's name be easy to pronounce?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes! Choose a name that is easy for you and your family to say consistently 🐘. Avoid names that sound too similar to common commands (like \\\"Kit\\\" for \\\"Sit\\\"). A clear, distinct name helps your African Elephant recognize when you are calling them and strengthens training effectiveness.\"}]]}],\"$L35\",\"$L36\"]}]]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-8\",\"children\":[\"📖 \",\"African Elephant\",\" Naming Guide\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"flex ga